 "bloques": [
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "The passive with -ся",
   "texto": [
    "With imperfect verbs bearing direct object **-ся** is added to the verb: **строить** → **строится** (built), **покупать** → **покупается** (purchased), **продавать** → **продаётся** (sold).",
    "The object becomes the subject: **Книги продаются здесь** (books are sold here)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Past and future",
   "texto": [
    "With imperfect, **-ся** presents the process: **Дом строился три года** (the house was under construction three years). To indicate that it was completed, the perfect: **Дом построили за три года** (built the house in three years) is usually used.",
    "The future **будет строиться** expresses a future process; **дорогу построят** indicates that they will build the road and expect to complete it. To name the agent, use the active: **Эту школу строит известная компания**."
   ]
  },
